{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ar-04-mateo-hartford-mail/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:37:24.164Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e7e20e1e772f9866f09bfdcc1133f36132bf64a7b9b9cfdfdd5dfe64d9c56da3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@gideon.sato Here's the draft summary for Mateo, taken from #inc-vtg-hartford. I haven't addressed a mail to him yet: he's outside pemberline.com, so I've asked @ruth.calloway to approve it first.\n\nDRAFT (not sent)\nSubject: Hartford gate kiosk incident, 3 Aug 2026 summary\n\nMateo,\n\nOn 3 Aug 2026 the gate kiosks at the Hartford plant went offline. Both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan, and reports were first logged at 10:42 AM. Dispatch scheduling kept working throughout; the outage affected gate check-in only. Kiosk 1 came back at about 11:03 AM, and both lanes were confirmed working at 11:07 AM. Carrowmere Cloud checked the Hartford gateway route and collected reconnect logs during the incident.\n\nYour access to the status page is being tracked separately under ticket INC-4821. Your admin account can open Pemberline Dock and see arrivals; the status-page access issue is still open.\n\nHappy to talk it through.\n\nGideon\n\nI'll post the approval status here once Ruth responds.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
